# Joint DES Y3 inference matched to the published analysis setup where the project allows it.
# Scores the released simulated measurement (sim_2pt and sim_map3 at the CosmoGrid cosmology), with no data_file override.
# xi rows follow the DES Y3 cosmic-shear scale cuts (data/upstream_cosmosis/des-y3-scale-cuts.ini): 227 of 400 xi rows and all 80 Map3 rows enter the chi2.
# The likelihood is the Percival t-distribution with the 796-simulation covariance and parameter_count 16, the published analysis's sampled count (it also samples mnu; the project fixes mnu = 0.06, see the README).
# No compression: the published analysis also compresses the cut xi block to 16 MOPED modes; set compression_file to that matrix once its provenance is confirmed.
# Source clipping and normalization follow the explicitly recorded demonstration source file (0.04 per cent of the bin-1 area differs from the raw n(z)).
# Priors differ from the published analysis by design: 10^9 A_s sampled uniformly (sigma8 derived) instead of a uniform S8, and mnu fixed.

two_point_file = upstream_y3/data/dv/sim_2pt-NLA-cosmoCosmogrid-04Nov24.fits
aperture_file = upstream_y3/data/dv/sim_map3_emu-NLA-cosmoCosmogrid-24FEBRUARY2025_WITH_COV.fits
cov_file = upstream_y3/data/covariance/xip_xim_map3_covariance_8ARCMINCUT_25Feb25.fits
nz_source_file = demonstration/y3_demo_sources.fits
source_ntomo = 4
data_file =
mask_file = y3_xi_scale_cut_mask.txt
compression_file =
mock_count = 796
parameter_count = 16
